OL,3,GNEWSAActivists' bank attack 'not
OL,4,Aterrorism-linked' - judge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn attack on a Barclays Bank by five
OL,7,Fpeople from the Palestine Action group
OL,8,Fwill not be treated as terrorism when
OL,9,Fthey are sentenced, a judge has ruled.
OL,11,FThe five smiled with relief and were
OL,12,Fhugged and cheered by supporters as the
OL,13,Fruling was given at Preston Crown Court
OL,14,Fearlier.
OL,16,FIt means all five will still be
OL,17,Fsentenced next month for criminal
OL,18,Fdamage in the attack on the bank in
OL,19,FBurnley, costing #200,000.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
