OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAActivists' bank attack 'not
OL,4,Aterrorism-linked' - judge
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Judge Robert Altham, the Recorder
OL,7,Fof Preston, ruled section 69 of the
OL,8,FSentencing Act, establishing a terror
OL,9,Flink to the criminal damage offence,
OL,10,Fdid not apply ` so the defendants will
OL,11,Fface lesser sentences when they are
OL,12,Fdealt with.
